<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Jasco to raise 7.5 mln rand in share issue.</title>
<headline>Jasco to raise 7.5 mln rand in share issue.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jasco Electronics Ltd said on Wednesday it would issue 3.75 million new shares to Capital Alliance Bank Ltd (Captall) at 200 cents a share, thereby raising 7.5 million rand.</p>
<p>The issue follows the purchase by empowerment grouping Captall of a 9.1 percent stake in the electronics to healthcare group.</p>
<p>Jasco said the share issue price represented a 4.76 perent discount to the market price prevailing when agreement was reached between the two firms.</p>
<p>The funds raised would be used to fund focused acquisitions.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
